            "pk": "18091086322952353",
            "text": "🚀Silkway Accelerator is currently the only accelerator in Central Asia for PMF- and Scale-stage startups, implemented by Astana Hub in partnership with Google for Startups.\n\nOver the course of 12 weeks, participants from Central Asia, the South Caucasus, and Mongolia go through an in-person acceleration program in Almaty, working closely with trackers, mentors, and international experts to strengthen core business metrics and prepare for scaling, entering new markets, and fundraising.\n\nWhat the program offers:\n— revenue and key metric growth\n— stronger sales performance\n— unit economics refinement\n— business scaling\n— preparation for fundraising\n\nParticipants also receive:\n📍 3 months offline in Almaty\n🏢 free coworking and coliving for 2 team members\n🌍 visa support for international startups\n🎓 mentorship from Astana Hub and Google for Startups (including up to $100,000 in Google Cloud)\n💲Demo Day with investors\n💫PR support\n\nIf your startup is ready for its next stage of growth and scaling, this is an opportunity to join a high-impact acceleration program and move to the next level.\n\nApply via the link in @almaty.hub.02 bio\nDeadline: April 30\n\n📌9 days left until applications for Silkway Accelerator close."
